P3 SURVIVED - explained, not a weak test: `topic_names` is ListField(child=CharField(max_length=100)),
and DRF's CharField trims whitespace by default (trim_whitespace=True) before update() runs, so
the .strip() in update() is a second layer. The trimming test still pins the end-to-end behavior
(an "  Cells " resend keeps the Cells row and its assignment). Killed: P1 (SET_NULL), P2 (match by name).
